      {
        "unit_id": "8c1a4a2ea24ab712d259875b86f07b7968d04ef820de537b9c88e15362307def",
        "unit_type": "prose",
        "text": "RESPECTED AND RALLYING, CAPTAIN LYSANDRA IRONVEIL STANDS AT THE FORE OF THE BATTLEFIELD WITH HER BREASTPLATE POLISHED AND CLOAK SNAPPING IN THE WIND, HER PRESENCE A BEACON OF DISCIPLINE AND HOPE. A MASTER OF TACTICAL MANEUVER AND A SEASONED INSPIRATIONAL LEADER, SHE EXPERTLY BLENDS SWIFT SWORDPLAY WITH BATTLEFIELD ORDERS THAT TURN THE TIDE OF BATTLE, COORDINATING HER ALLIES WITH PIERCING SHOUTS AND CALCULATED STRIKES. HER INDOMITABLE WILL, FORGED THROUGH THE DEFENSE OF HER CITY AND THE TRIBULATIONS OF COMMAND, GRANTS HER NEAR-UNSHAKABLE RESOLVE—EVEN IN THE PRESENCE OF THE MOST HARROWING FOES—AND AN AURA THAT STEELS HER COMPANIONS AGAINST AMBUSH AND FEAR. UNDER LYSANDRA'S VIGILANT GAZE, CHAOS BECOMES COHESION, AND FALTERING HEARTS ARE STEADIED FOR VICTORY.\nArmor Class : 16\nHit Points: 52 Hit Dice : 7d8+14\nSpeed: walk : 30",
